# aptitude — full-screen APT front end

## Search for packages

```sh
aptitude search "whatever"
```

## Display package records

```sh
aptitude show pkg
```

## Install / remove a package

```sh
aptitude install package
aptitude remove package
```

## Clean out obsolete downloaded packages

```sh
aptitude autoclean
```

## Real-world: interactive dependency untangling

```sh
# aptitude proposes resolutions when dependencies conflict —
# handy when apt-get just gives up
sudo aptitude install problematic-package
```

## Real-world: what's been held back?

```sh
aptitude search '~ahold'
```

| Command   | What it does                    |
| --------- | ------------------------------- |
| search    | find packages (supports ~terms) |
| show      | package record                  |
| install   | install w/ resolver             |
| remove    | remove package                  |
| autoclean | drop obsolete .deb cache        |
